      ],
      "entries": [
        "A nikaramsa is in fact a Medium creature, but appears as a Large creature due to the force of their personality. A creature interacting with the nikaramsa can attempt a DC 36 Will save to see the nikaramsa as they truly are. If the creature succeeds, the reach of nikaramsa's attacks against that foe decrease to 5 feet (10 feet for their tongue). If all creatures in the nikaramsa's vicinity successfully disbelieve this illusion|CRB|2|disbelieving illusions|0, the nikaramsa becomes Medium and enfeebled 2 for as long as everyone sees their true form."
      ],
